Package: s7urvey
Title: S7 Object Handling of Survey Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Hunter", "Johnson", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Represents survey questions as single S7 objects that reflect
    how respondents and researchers think about them, independent of how
    the underlying data file stores each question as one or more raw
    columns.
